---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    Embedded Software Engineer with experience across real-time defence systems, warehouse robotics, and research-focused
    control engineering. Skilled in C, C++ and Python, embedded drivers, ROS/ROS2, autonomous systems, and high-reliability software
    design for operational environments.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Master of Science in Robotics Engineering, cum Laude"
      subtitle="University of Genoa • October 2023"
    >
      Graduate-level, international (EMARO) robotics engineering program, with a strong focus on robotics theory, control, real-time systems, and more.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Bachelor of Science in Computer Engineering"
      subtitle="University of Genoa • October 2021"
    >
      Computer engineering degree with a strong foundation in software systems, embedded design, and computational methods.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Defence Embedded Software Engineer"
      subtitle="Leonardo SpA • La Spezia, Italy • June 2025 – Present"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Designed and developed high-reliability embedded software drivers in C++ for real-time defence systems.</li>
        <li>Focused on mission-critical functionality with deterministic behaviour and strict timing guarantees.</li>
        <li>Worked with military safety and robustness requirements for naval and land platforms.</li>
        <li>Engineered low-level drivers, custom operating systems, and board support packages for Texas Instruments Sitara/Concerto/Delfino/DaVinci, Xilinx, and Nios II platforms.</li>
        <li>Ensured long-term maintainability and reliability of core software modules for weapon systems such as naval cannons and tanks.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Robotics Engineer"
      subtitle="Magazino GmbH • Munich, Germany • November 2023 – May 2025"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Specialised in seamless integration and testing of autonomous robots for warehouse intralogistics.</li>
        <li>Worked with clients across Europe including Bosch, MAN Truck &amp; Bus, Zalando, and Ford.</li>
        <li>Developed data analysis software tools to support debugging and performance analysis of robot behaviour.</li>
        <li>Solved customer-specific challenges and tailored solutions to unique operational requirements.</li>
        <li>Maintained strong documentation and procedural standardization across engineering workflows.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Master Thesis Researcher"
      subtitle="Italian Institute of Technology (IIT) • Genoa, Italy • February 2023 – October 2023"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Designed a novel hybrid force/position whole-body control approach for legged robots on inclined sandy terrain up to 30°.</li>
        <li>Integrated the method into the Unitree Aliengo quadruped platform.</li>
        <li>Experimentally demonstrated up to 40% improvement in locomotion performance in challenging terrain scenarios.</li>
        <li>Published and presented the work at CLAWAR 2024: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-71301-9_29" target="_blank" class="underline">https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-71301-9_29</a></li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Bachelor Thesis Researcher"
      subtitle="University of Genoa • Genoa, Italy • June 2021 – October 2021"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Simulated an Autonomous Underwater Vehicle (AUV) model with variable centre of mass in MATLAB.</li>
        <li>Improved underwater dynamics by designing an enhanced control module to exploit the vehicle's centre-of-mass variability.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Freelance Software Engineer"
      subtitle="Dedalus Software House • Genoa, Italy • December 2018 – July 2019"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Developed full-stack websites for clients in the mental healthcare sector.</li>
        <li>Improved engineering standards, workflow efficiency, and code quality across client projects.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Freelance Software Developer"
      subtitle="SIS SRL Informatica e Sistemi • Genoa, Italy • May 2017 – June 2017"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Designed and implemented a web-based user interface for large-scale customer databases with millions of records.</li>
        <li>Created additional database tables to improve functionality and administration.</li>
        <li>The project was adopted commercially and extended beyond the internship period.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Projects</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Dual-Arm Cooperative Robotic Control (Franka Emika Panda)"
      subtitle="Research and development"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Developed a task-cooperative control algorithm for two 7-DOF Franka Panda manipulators.</li>
        <li>Optimised multi-arm coordination and collision avoidance.</li>
        <li>Modeled advanced kinematics and dynamics to execute synchronized trajectories for complex manipulation tasks.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="UVMS Cooperative Control &amp; Kinematic Modeling"
      subtitle="Autonomous underwater systems"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Developed a task-cooperative control algorithm for an AUV integrated with a 6-DOF manipulator.</li>
        <li>Managed highly coupled vehicle-arm dynamics in a realistic operating scenario.</li>
        <li>Engineered compliant control strategies to enable dynamic interaction with external environments.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="ADHD Assistant / Productivity Tool"
      subtitle="AI-assisted productivity"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Developed a productivity tool for ADHD users using LLMs for intelligent task management.</li>
        <li>Built scalable backend logic with GCP Cloud Functions.</li>
        <li>Ensured seamless integration with APIs and modular, maintainable software design.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Early Development: Autonomous 3-DOF Robotic Arm"
      subtitle="Embedded systems and motion control"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Independently designed and programmed a 3-DOF manipulator from scratch.</li>
        <li>Learned and applied forward kinematics and embedded control fundamentals.</li>
        <li>Integrated an Arduino microcontroller with servo motors and developed custom firmware for precise motion execution.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-3 columns-2 mx-6 mb-10">
    <li>C++</li>
    <li>C</li>
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>Assembly</li>
    <li>MATLAB</li>
    <li>JavaScript / TypeScript</li>
    <li>Java</li>
    <li>SQL</li>
    <li>PHP</li>
    <li>HTML / CSS</li>
    <li>ROS1</li>
    <li>ROS2</li>
    <li>MATLAB &amp; Simulink</li>
    <li>RViz</li>
    <li>Gazebo</li>
    <li>Docker</li>
    <li>CREO</li>
    <li>Unreal Engine 5</li>
    <li>English</li>
    <li>Italian</li>
    <li>German (B2)</li>
    <li>Thai</li>
    <li>French</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
